  "Files or globs of files that will be excluded by Wu entirely. They will be skipped during file scans, file searches, and not be displayed in the project file tree. Takes precedence over \"File Scan Inclusions\"": "Wu 将完全排除的文件或文件 Glob 模式。扫描文件、搜索文件时会跳过它们，项目文件树中也不会显示。优先于“文件扫描包含项”。",
  "Files or globs of files that will be included by Wu, even when ignored by git. This is useful for files that are not tracked by git, but are still important to your project. Note that globs that are overly broad can slow down Wu's file scanning. \"File Scan Exclusions\" takes precedence over these inclusions": "即使被 Git 忽略，Wu 也会包含的文件或文件 Glob 模式。适用于未被 Git 跟踪但对项目仍然重要的文件。注意，范围过宽的 Glob 模式会拖慢 Wu 的文件扫描。“文件扫描排除项”优先于这些包含项。",
  "Fold each turn's thinking, tool calls and narration into one line, leaving only the reply.": "将每一轮的思考、工具调用和说明折叠成一行，只保留回复。",
