  "Show Claude Code in the new chat menu and in Continue Saved Chat. At least one agent stays shown.": "在新建对话菜单和“继续已保存的对话”中显示 Claude Code。至少会保留一个智能体。",
  "Show Codex in the new chat menu and in Continue Saved Chat. At least one agent stays shown.": "在新建对话菜单和“继续已保存的对话”中显示 Codex。至少会保留一个智能体。",
  "Show OpenCode in the new chat menu and in Continue Saved Chat. At least one agent stays shown.": "在新建对话菜单和“继续已保存的对话”中显示 OpenCode。至少会保留一个智能体。",
  "Show a microphone button for on-device dictation.": "显示用于本地听写的麦克风按钮。",
  "Show a notification when an agent finishes, needs input or fails.": "智能体完成、需要输入或失败时显示通知。",
  "Show a notification when an agent finishes, needs input or fails. Allow Wu to send notifications in System Settings for this to work.": "智能体完成、需要输入或失败时显示通知。需要在“系统设置”中允许 Wu 发送通知才能生效。",
  "Show the activity bar with the dock panel buttons on the side of the window.": "在窗口侧边显示带有停靠栏面板按钮的活动栏。",
  "Show the agent panel and its commands. When off, Wu hides everything agent-related.": "显示智能体面板及其命令。关闭后，Wu 会隐藏所有与智能体相关的内容。",
  "Show the search panel button in the activity bar.": "在活动栏中显示搜索面板按钮。",
  "Size of the activity bar icons, in pixels.": "活动栏图标的大小（像素）。",
  "Sound On Error": "出错时播放声音",
  "Sound When Done": "完成时播放声音",
  "Sound When Input Is Needed": "需要输入时播放声音",
  "The agent that writes commit messages in the Git panel. When unset, the first installed agent.": "在 Git 面板中生成提交消息的智能体。未设置时使用第一个已安装的智能体。",
  "The context size, in tokens, that triggers compaction. Between 100K and 1M.": "触发压缩的上下文大小（以 token 计）。范围为 100K 到 1M。",
  "The custom set of icons Wu will associate with files and directories.": "Wu 为文件和文件夹使用的图标集。",
  "The effort new chats start with. Last Used keeps the effort of your last chat with that agent. A model that doesn't offer it uses its own default.": "新对话开始时使用的推理强度。“上次使用”会沿用你与该智能体上一次对话的推理强度。不支持该推理强度的模型会使用自己的默认值。",
  "The language of Wu's menus, panels and settings. Some parts update after you reopen them or restart Wu.": "Wu 的菜单、面板和设置所用的语言。部分内容需要重新打开或重启 Wu 后才会更新。",
  "The layout of the model and effort picker.": "模型和推理强度选择器的布局。",
  "The model that writes commit messages. When unset, a small, fast model.": "生成提交消息的模型。未设置时使用一个小而快的模型。",
  "The permission mode new Claude Code chats start with. You can still change it in each chat.": "新的 Claude Code 对话开始时使用的权限模式。你仍可以在每个对话中更改。",
  "The permission mode new Codex chats start with. You can still change it in each chat.": "新的 Codex 对话开始时使用的权限模式。你仍可以在每个对话中更改。",
  "The permission mode new OpenCode chats start with. You can still change it in each chat.": "新的 OpenCode 对话开始时使用的权限模式。你仍可以在每个对话中更改。",
  "Use LSP tasks over Wu language extension tasks.": "优先使用 LSP 任务，而不是 Wu 语言扩展中的任务。",
  "What a message sent while the agent is working does. Queue sends it when the agent finishes; Steer sends it right away.": "智能体工作时发送的消息如何处理。“排队”会在智能体完成后发送；“引导”会立即发送。",
  "What to restore from the previous session when opening Wu.": "打开 Wu 时从上次会话中恢复的内容。",
  "When enabled, Wu will prefer already-open buffers.": "启用后，Wu 会优先使用已打开的缓冲区。",
  "When opening Wu, avoid Restricted Mode by auto-trusting all projects, enabling use of all features without having to give permission to each new project.": "打开 Wu 时自动信任所有项目，不进入受限模式，无需为每个新项目单独授权即可使用所有功能。",
  "Where to dock a chat you move out of its tab.": "从标签页移出的对话停靠的位置。",
  "Where to dock the search panel.": "搜索面板停靠的位置。",
  "Whether breakpoints should be reused across Wu sessions.": "是否在 Wu 的不同会话之间保留断点。",
  "Whether files open with a single click or a double click.": "单击还是双击打开文件。",
  "Whether to automatically surround text with characters for you. For example, when you select text and type '(', Wu will automatically surround text with ().": "是否自动用字符包围文本。例如，选中文本后输入“(”，Wu 会自动用 () 包围文本。",
  "Whether to automatically type closing characters for you. For example, when you type '(', Wu will automatically add a closing ')' at the correct position.": "是否自动为你输入闭合字符。例如，输入“(”时，Wu 会自动在正确的位置添加闭合的“)”。",
  "Whether to log messages between active debug adapters and Wu.": "是否记录活动调试适配器与 Wu 之间的消息。",
  "Which key sends a message from the chat box.": "在对话输入框中用哪个键发送消息。",
  "Which side of the window the activity bar is on.": "活动栏位于窗口的哪一侧。",
  "While Working": "工作时发送",
  "Window title template. Available variables are `${projectName}`, `${fileName}`, `${filePath}`, `${relativePath}`, `${fileStem}`, `${remoteName}`, `${remoteHost}`, `${appName}`, `${branch}`, and `${separator}`. `${separator}` is omitted when adjacent variables are empty, but literal text is preserved. If the template renders to nothing, the default template is used instead.": "窗口标题模板。可用变量有 `${projectName}`、`${fileName}`、`${filePath}`、`${relativePath}`、`${fileStem}`、`${remoteName}`、`${remoteHost}`、`${appName}`、`${branch}` 和 `${separator}`。相邻变量为空时会省略 `${separator}`，但会保留普通文字。如果模板渲染结果为空，则使用默认模板。",
